// ............................................................................ 
// Quests
// ............................................................................ 

Q_ECATERINAVITAE_S              Bring elder vitae to Josef.
Q_ECATERINAVITAE_L              Request vitae from an elder Cainite of beautiful visage and bring it to Josef in North Quarter.
Q_GOLEM_S                       Kill the Golem.
Q_GOLEM_L                       Destroy the Golem that terrorizes Northern Quarter.
Q_SHEMMENDEL_S                  Bring the Shem back to Mendel.
Q_SHEMMENDEL_L                  Bring the Shem you found on the golem's corpse back to Mendel.
Q_PRAGUEBYNIGHT_S               Protect Prague By Night.
Q_PRAGUEBYNIGHT_L               Defend all of Old Town from the monsters that prowl by night.
Q_SILVERMINES_S                 Reclaim the Bonn Silver Mines.
Q_SILVERMINES_L                 Leave Prague through the East Gate and enter the mines. Defeat the monsters that dwell within.
Q_TREMERECHANTRY_S              Invade Tremere Chantry.
Q_TREMERECHANTRY_L              Invade the Tremere Chantry hidden beneath the pharmacy on Golden Lane.
Q_RELIQUARY_S                   Retrieve Reliquary.
Q_RELIQUARY_L                   Enter Josef's Tunnels in the Northern Quarter cemetary, and retrieve the Reliquary for Prince Brandl.
Q_NODFRAGMENT_S                 Recover the Nod fragment.
Q_NODFRAGMENT_L                 Cross Judith Bridge and enter Petrin Hill Monastery. Find the Nod Fragment and bring it to Ecaterina.
Q_SHEM_S                        Bring the Shem to Garinol.
Q_SHEM_L                        Bring the Shem to Garinol outside Petrin Hill Monastery.
Q_GEZA_S                        Return to St. Thomas.
Q_GEZA_L                        Return to St. Thomas' Cathdedral to speak with Archbishop Geza.
Q_ANEZKAVISIT_S                 Visit Sister Anezka.
Q_ANEZKAVISIT_L                 Return to the convent to visit Sister Anezka.
Q_LEAVEVIENNA_S                 Leave for Vienna by the East Gate.
Q_LEAVEVIENNA_L                 Leave Prague through the East Gate and continue your search for Anezka in Vienna.
Q_RESTTOADVANCE_S               Return to rest in haven.
Q_RESTTOADVANCE_L               Return to rest in the University haven and click on the Rest Coffin to advance.

